및 안전 매뉴얼</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>교육 이수 여부: </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="25"><CHAR>전 대상자 완료</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>실시간 온도기록 유지: </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="26"><CHAR>75% 시설만 작성</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>열사병 응급대응 지침 부착: </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>7곳 누락</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR> → 6곳 정정</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="31181" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅲ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="1131"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="26345"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>3. 개선 필요사항</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>주의가 필요한 사항은 다음과 같습니다:</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>1. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>냉방기 가동 점검을 주 1회에서 → </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="25"><CHAR>주 2회</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>로 상향</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>2. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>음용수 냉장고는 </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="26"><CHAR>6월 10일까지 교체</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR> 완료 필요</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>3. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>응급 상황 대비 매뉴얼 미부착 시설:</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>○○동 주민센터</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>△△경로당</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>
</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>  ❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>특히 해당 시설은</CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="25"><CHAR>노약자 비율 70% 이상</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>1. </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>근무자 교대 시 인수인계 확인표가 누락되는 사례 다수</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="21" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="16"><TABLE BorderFill="3" CellSpacing="0" ColCount="3" PageBreak="Cell" RepeatHeader="true" RowCount="1"><SHAPEOBJECT InstId="1805978309" Lock="false" NumberingType="Table" ZOrder="1"><SIZE Height="3231" HeightRelTo="Absolute" Protect="false" Width="37035" WidthRelTo="Absolute"/><POSITION AffectLSpacing="false" AllowOverlap="false" FlowWithText="true" HoldAnchorAndSO="false" HorzAlign="Left" HorzOffset="0" HorzRelTo="Para" TreatAsChar="true" VertAlign="Top" VertOffset="0" VertRelTo="Para"/><OUTSIDEMARGIN Bottom="283" Left="283" Right="283" Top="283"/></SHAPEOBJECT><INSIDEMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><ROW><CELL BorderFill="6" ColAddr="0" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="3705"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="23" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="8"><CHAR>Ⅳ</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="7" ColAddr="1" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="1131"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ParaShape="0" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="9"/></P></PARALIST></CELL><CELL BorderFill="8" ColAddr="2" ColSpan="1" Dirty="false" Editable="false" HasMargin="false" Header="false" Height="3231" Protect="false" RowAddr="0" RowSpan="1" Width="32199"><CELLMARGIN Bottom="141" Left="141" Right="141" Top="141"/><PARALIST LineWrap="Break" LinkListID="0" LinkListIDNext="0" TextDirection="0" VertAlign="Center"><P ColumnBreak="false" PageBreak="false" ParaShape="24" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="12"><COLDEF Count="1" Layout="Left" SameGap="0" SameSize="true" Type="Newspaper"/><CHAR>4. 향후 조치 계획</CHAR></TEXT></P></PARALIST></CELL></ROW></TABLE><CHAR/></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>6월 초: 냉방장비 점검 완료</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>6월 중순: 안내문 및 매뉴얼 일괄 배포</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>7월 1주차: 1차 실사용 현장 모니터링</CHAR></TEXT></P><P ParaShape="29" Style="0"><TEXT CharShape="23"><CHAR>❍ </CHAR></TEXT><TEXT CharShape="20"><CHAR>7월 중순~8월: 주간 운영보고 수합</CHAR></TEXT></P></SECTION></BODY><TAIL><SCRIPTCODE Type="JScript" Version="1.0"><SCRIPTHEADER/><SCRIPTSOURCE/></SCRIPTCODE></TAIL></HWPML>